<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport from Indore to Hyderabad | Safe Auto Carrier
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does it typically take to transport a car from Indore to Hyderabad?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The transit distance of roughly 850 km via the NH44/NH33 corridor is covered in 14‑18 hours of driving time, depending on traffic and weather conditions. Including loading, unloading, and any mandatory stops, most customers receive their vehicle at the destination within 2‑3 days.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures does Shree Ashirwad use to prevent scratches or damage during the Indore‑Hyderabad car move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad employs a 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging system, hydraulic ramp trailers with wheel chocks, high‑tensile ratchet lashings, and GPS‑enabled live tracking. Every vehicle is inspected before loading, and an IRDAI‑approved marine‑transit insurance covers any unforeseen incidents, guaranteeing a zero‑scratch promise.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any hidden charges in the car transport quote between Indore and Hyderabad?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">No hidden fees are added after the initial quote. The estimate includes distance‑based charges, vehicle size classification, insurance premium, and any optional services such as door‑to‑door handling or extra padding. Taxes, tolls, and state permits are disclosed upfront, ensuring complete price transparency.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Which documents are mandatory for moving a vehicle interstate from Indore to Hyderabad?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The essential paperwork comprises the original registration certificate, valid insurance policy, a government‑issued photo ID of the owner, a signed consent form authorizing transport, and an e‑Way bill generated for the freight. A copy of the GSTIN is required for corporate clients.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my car in real time while it travels from Indore to Hyderabad?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Each carrier is equipped with a satellite‑linked GPS unit that feeds live location data to our customer portal. Clients receive a secure link to monitor the vehicle’s progress, view estimated arrival times, and receive instant alerts for any route deviations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance included in the car transport service, and what does it cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">A comprehensive, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance is included in every shipment. It covers total loss, partial damage, and accidental scratches up to the declared value of the vehicle. Customers may increase coverage limits for high‑value cars by providing a higher declared value at the time of booking.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How should I prepare my car before it is loaded onto the hydraulic ramp trailer?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Before loading, remove personal belongings, ensure the fuel tank is no more than a quarter full, deactivate alarms, and check for existing damages. Document the car’s condition with photos, lock the steering, and keep the keys handy for the driver. Following these steps helps a smooth, damage‑free loading process.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
